  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Support Implementation to BSAAT SoC Project.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This MoU will focus on Serious and Organised Crime (SOC) work in Tanzania and will contribute to the Building Sustainable Anti-Corruption Action in Tanzania (BSAAT) programme. This project has been developed in close collaboration with the UK Government and the EU Delegation in Tanzania, the project&#x2019;s funding partners. The project seeks to strengthen Tanzania&#x2019;s ability to respond to the international dimensions of Serious and Organised Crime (SoC).</narrative>
  </description>
